config MT6797_HIF_COMPILE_TEST
	bool "Compile MT6797 HIF protocol and MMIO boundary"
	depends on ARM64 && COMPILE_TEST
	default n
	help
	  Compile the experimental PIO/INIT/ordinary-section components with
	  ordered Linux MMIO accessors. This registers no device, runs no test
	  at boot and provides no operational Wi-Fi driver. It acquires no
	  resources and never enables a connectivity power domain.
	  Say N normally.
